{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「CAPCOM」攤位報導！在「惡靈古堡」區域體驗射擊，還能試玩「魔物獵人」「洛克人」系列最新作品</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c5e46c1c3401bce5a027b03012dcdb8dc6293b9543d2203fbc0caeeb01177c25/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe839f79189a7c442af3a910b58e3bef0.jpg\"/><p>2026年9月17日（四）至20日（日）舉行的「 東京電玩展2026 」 這次要為大家帶來持續推出《 惡靈古堡：安魂曲 》、《 人機迷網 》等話題作品的「 CAPCOM 」攤位報導！</p><h3>「CAPCOM」攤位報導！從「惡靈古堡」到「快打旋風6」再到「魔物獵人」，話題作品一次大集合</h3><p>東京丸井×惡靈古堡區域</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7cd1301a4474d4c6afda6b6a01794a83aa32e01c26d9ee505ffbeaeb6f1d8d46/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Faa5ae4f51dddef85d9fba266c75fd31b.jpg\"/><p>首先從「惡靈古堡」區域開始！</p><p>惡靈古堡 30週年</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8b56c3a8d3ba98c5a3165906151b65b2409c5be7866239bedc7116752a29b1da/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F35bd18a9bda6b208999542a4b27561a5.jpg\"/><p>2026年迎來「惡靈古堡」系列30週年！ 現場展示了為紀念30週年所繪製的特別藝術圖。</p><p>槍械商店「KENDO」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/803c85231a6194d4b3e5a90a2ecd6173a7f476be3a1dbf5132c0be46ba155f1d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5458615dac5c865826470de8fdf13159.jpg\"/><p>在區域內發現了槍械商店「KENDO」！</p><p>閃電之鷹 .50AE 10英吋 Mag Port Custom</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8c14adba429a1b66bef2f1add325c84fa086524b15d0645def740be56ab70f5e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F91264e16f142c6eb37ed25301f48e3c4.jpg\"/><p>武士之刃Standard Model〈High Grade Type〉</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8357002f6a749fdbc783af6b14e7f9ce4d6389ff2c4422c0d9e9ac79953a0637/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F824589639883e8b2103cad73b6e2032f.jpg\"/><p>Sentinel Nine Leon Model</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b3fd2f31d599e88c483336c462acdaa6aa3a94a1562e4669e2dab1384dfcab47/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F25797fb1a8c4d7d08c5eddfa5d0567f2.jpg\"/><p>阿什福德黃金魯格／阿什福德黃金浮雕</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/50d54a498552f49dd53ec7f1fadc48703b2c0fed35d0b7a8eb5173d98c2c5588/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9da8df1c31e36dc3226bbfd43db41fd1.jpg\"/><p>店內整齊陳列著東京丸井與惡靈古堡合作推出的各款氣槍。 每一把都非常帥氣，讓人忍不住看得入迷。</p><p>區域內還設置了射擊訓練場。</p><p>喪屍</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bc1d4faa69fe82da9206fdd91baea9c7013f6f9f1c57d890bdf96c19371a468a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb6d4a1e0ad6c578c771d3aa94a9f9115.jpg\"/><p>朝著喪屍進行射擊！</p><p>瞄準目標</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/209bc61416e68a36c535c2ecd4334d94d8ca09f5a33a51c586ce5b68cb386347/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3cd0caab53e0ce3589dc7f824df38ae1.jpg\"/><p>射擊！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/04e35f8f2187c6cef62e8c8e51e1361396a03ba166ab671e08d0528188c1328b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff52933434edebe14a925f2a736815c78.jpg\"/><p>以銳利的眼神瞄準目標後扣下扳機！</p><p>訓練結束</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c2f21d55da5619f11486f4aa458e313ccbfabad0211b2c56684a8bd5bbac6ad2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F384b24970251271d92e5a01827c789c3.jpg\"/><p>順利命中喪屍，射擊體驗也就此結束。</p><p>可以獲得自己射擊過的靶紙</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f8b90d900e85474884ecdf571dedfb44d503da3ddf103d185bcde22c524ea0af/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb03be72d13bf9c8c94ec7ec318dff143.jpg\"/><p>參加訓練後，可以獲得自己實際射擊過的喪屍靶紙，以及作為紀念品的「惡靈古堡×東京丸井 2027合作月曆」。</p><p>「惡靈古堡」重製系列3部作品</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f3d873a6d56440a0293de4e33110212b8af39418fa8c00adb03fa9ad589d7c15/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F004a723d342b20845747e99bc6cf5866.jpg\"/><p>也很期待 「惡靈古堡」重製系列3部作品 的發售。</p><h3>快打旋風6</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e00fe1852b48cd5198d23ea4856827681390f760a7da05fb68532f65eafc2ac0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Feb531a5fade4f210450b60db01cc93dc.jpg\"/><p>接下來來到《快打旋風6》區域！</p><p>電影《快打旋風／The Movie》</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f714748854e6744316cb56a0ccb2faa56edb887f7e35d61a15734dbda75d55fc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F84558f79d72d03ecfd070de76d25d7d3.jpg\"/><p>隆</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/37d55c1f63bea2708a4337bf72d7e1c95cb1af2177d5fa869a17957a0b47722c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5ce1ff63bbcb2d5738e1b86d36d0aa65.jpg\"/><p>春麗</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/47f342b968e96ccf3a9a5e3747bf91b23c8d6b92d8abac57d27373bd3a7199df/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd990a98d9ba7ca1b456c609733cd3563.jpg\"/><p>肯</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b61f37e3f5c2c19c8fe1c816016317cf3e8bbf85a03f0364bc79946c7c7ec25c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbc460b7b9567f69285c3d5bc3238c2dc.jpg\"/><p>現場可以看到 電影《快打旋風／The Movie》 的主視覺圖，以及隆、春麗、肯的服裝。</p><p>等身大的桑吉爾夫立牌</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f139c7aae79a0dcf3c6a2861a1f4e1f0f9604abe7b9fc4adc634603a75fe506b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F936e9ad57eb32caf7bc3e98f5a03e645.jpg\"/><p>此外，現場還有等身大的桑吉爾夫立牌！ 讓人忍不住拿起相機拍照。</p><p>相關周邊商品區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/24be7bf603c461a6afd771ca2bd183440a19b360835882bf48310b21503b358e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F46cd9c375a3026c9980050ad27e170bf.jpg\"/><p>壓克力立牌</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2d77f0ae91483b9a474eaa7c109044ae510230500079ae6ff8870af00a58c4ce/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F564a8a8554ebf0fef00400890ff7413d.jpg\"/><p>貼紙與杯子</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0c35fd7a409b597a71bfc7497ed2798d426d7fbbab7eb58d42374d6ce1224d5b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1bbecfa9f78ec7e7ec26e72dd7a29aaf.jpg\"/><p>貼紙組</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b7f2eb1d5355f763c1a14cb90bdbec09d177a507b579216a64d56285e14a20fc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4beeb59617a50f4a9b0c0a6d243449f0.jpg\"/><p>相關周邊商品區擺滿了壓克力立牌、貼紙、貼紙組等讓粉絲垂涎不已的商品。</p><p>世界戰士錦標賽的邀請函</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5cd2391c0f0c7e9e38f3cce3f70deed98dcd5a9e8c22984a4a05e40a6f10b3c8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3bc8b3cb452e09537539c2d421c06529.jpg\"/><p>現場還展示了作為故事重要道具的世界戰士錦標賽邀請函。 據說，這件道具將成為故事的契機，揭開一場波瀾壯闊的故事序幕，實際的劇情就請親自觀看電影確認吧！</p><h3>魔物獵人</h3><p>魔物獵人 荒野：Ascendance</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b2040253142484c4b2f80e931705878f2dc4c9a10f5573406e199e0401b384ea/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb2a10992926641260c706b186ffff20f.jpg\"/><p>魔物獵人：旅人</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bfcdabd030708668b5c558c71468d69860f96aaff6d52addffbda82d9588a0d4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F45ca7b6882c8e06bd174c48c117daf9f.jpg\"/><p>接下來來到的是《魔物獵人》區域。 為了避免自己一直沉浸在預計於2027年發售的 《魔物獵人 荒野：Ascendance》 以及 《魔物獵人：旅人》 的精彩插畫中，我們繼續進行採訪。</p><p>試玩區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/60ae7d965eba09b2a8fa4f5d947354907b0768820a10596127b1c1df3fa65e60/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff755d1228fd843374e4354568eb38179.jpg\"/><p>在區域內的《魔物獵人 荒野：Ascendance》試玩區，獵人們爭先恐後地聚集在一起。 沉浸於全新的冒險舞台之中。</p><p>實際試玩充滿臨場感的狩獵任務！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/067841de75e51ba95009a6618de5455cc905987a3e01801f2657d398cbadb310/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0950d82cfc714bfd82063e8240ad2229.jpg\"/><p>實際體驗了《魔物獵人 荒野：Ascendance》。 充滿臨場感的狩獵任務讓人忍不住熱血沸騰。</p><p>Nintendo Switch 2版《魔物獵人：荒野》試玩區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9fc29806663a7564de049bb7f7d586d0a8b660b5e33c76d58ab4659b5cd4db8c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F45e95f4f3714bfc8ea605a9adadc8bb7.jpg\"/><p>Switch 2也能玩《荒野》！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2f55889d9fe149828d0d9ce47308bdba4e5f0a037eff70ff07131e1a245bcf39/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff5dd441dea0c1ccfde31ed31de31fb81.jpg\"/><p>現場也設置了將於2026年12月4日（五）發售的Nintendo Switch 2版《魔物獵人：荒野》試玩區。</p><p>舒瓦爾卡α系列</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/811c918f3272adae0f411c5871ac64cdb7d75661da72f06c435c643a0e0b1377/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F69a5f225e56e478534fcaa8ebceed024.jpg\"/><p>阿爾修布拉多拉</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2f6569431a977d0955d13481d44a163ed71c4c181cb63834d58ef063b7ba95c8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9832f8a1c2185b982cac5575f370f599.jpg\"/><p>希望之刃</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/207f88f7bf5f1ccbdea8c3f5ef7591f77254352bf3c54149f6c0048f1245f8e8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F50c861d6289f1c87398bb9324e595ff6.jpg\"/><p>希望之鎚</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d0f5a5fbe4c166afaed7ffb17004e54b2d3396b2a00ccfcb24a9e171b1e516f2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd46cbf662efde2b879bf7198bcc27734.jpg\"/><p>展示區還展出了遊戲中登場的……</p><p>舒瓦爾卡α系列</p><p>阿爾修布拉多拉</p><p>希望之刃</p><p>希望之鎚</p><p>……等裝備，許多參觀者都在展示品前拍照留念。</p><p>手帕與貼紙</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dcadc6a8ffc234019500f4d4f16061caa1730f9b33548a7bf45ae8b7bd8d9066/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbe6e7c1a55ff9bc1d733bbc639b9e2ad.jpg\"/><p>此外，還獲得了作為紀念品的《魔物獵人：荒野：Ascendance》超細纖維手帕，以及「盡情狩獵吧」貼紙。</p><h3>鬼武者 Way of the Sword</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/21432d7cb3d61380d307e4f867b2df4b94bbaba68527d5f5f5fe4043fe709523/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F752622a507b87543f867a9733f0688d3.jpg\"/><p>接下來來到2026年9月4日（五）才剛發售、目前話題正熱的《 鬼武者 Way of the Sword 》區域。</p><p>挑戰企劃</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/39c542c3b39a560a0f8c6ffe45435166841b7223286fc2c544ca8af803eb8951/lig